---
---

<section id="testimonios" class="bg-[#101828] py-24">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">

    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-[#399ABE]/15 border border-[#399ABE]/30 text-[#399ABE] text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-5">★ Testimonios</span>
    <h2 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight leading-[1.08] mb-4">Directores que ya<br><span class="text-[#399ABE]">transformaron su academia</span></h2>
    <p class="text-[17px] text-[#8a9ab0] leading-relaxed max-w-xl mb-14">Más de 70 academias en Latinoamérica ya gestionan con AKDEMIApp. Esto es lo que dicen.</p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_400px] gap-16 items-center mb-16">
      <div>
        <div class="flex gap-1 mb-7"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F59E0B"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F59E0B"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F59E0B"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F59E0B"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F59E0B"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg></div>
        <blockquote class="text-[24px] font-medium text-white leading-[1.55] tracking-tight italic mb-9 border-l-[3px] border-[#399ABE] pl-6">
          &ldquo;Antes gestionábamos todo con hojas de cálculo y grupos de WhatsApp, era un caos. Con AKDEMIApp tenemos horarios, asistencias, pagos y comunicaciones centralizados en un solo lugar. Hemos ganado en organización y en imagen profesional.&rdquo;
        </blockquote>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
          <div class="w-[52px] h-[52px] rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#155D88] to-[#399ABE] flex items-center justify-center text-white text-lg font-extrabold shrink-0">TH</div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-[18px] font-extrabold text-white">Tony Hernández</p>
            <p class="text-[13px] text-[#399ABE] font-semibold">Propietario y Director</p>
            <p class="text-[12px] text-[#5a7080] mt-0.5">TH Espacio de Danza — México</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex mt-10 border border-white/[0.08] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
          <div class="flex-1 py-5 px-6 border-r border-white/[0.08] text-center"><span class="block text-[28px] font-extrabold text-[#399ABE] tracking-tight">3x</span><span class="text-[12px] text-[#5a7080] mt-1 block">más rápido</span></div>
          <div class="flex-1 py-5 px-6 border-r border-white/[0.08] text-center"><span class="block text-[28px] font-extrabold text-[#399ABE] tracking-tight">100%</span><span class="text-[12px] text-[#5a7080] mt-1 block">digital</span></div>
          <div class="flex-1 py-5 px-6 text-center"><span class="block text-[28px] font-extrabold text-[#399ABE] tracking-tight">0</span><span class="text-[12px] text-[#5a7080] mt-1 block">hojas Excel</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-[0_24px_64px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] border border-white/[0.08]">
          <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Tony Hernández — TH Espacio de Danza" class="w-full block object-cover" />
        </div>
        <div class="absolute -bottom-4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bg-[#155D88] text-white px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-[13px] font-bold whitespace-nowrap shadow-lg border border-white/15 flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
  <path d="M6 9H4.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5H6"/>
  <path d="M18 9h1.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 0-5H18"/>
  <path d="M4 22h16"/>
  <path d="M10 14.66V17c0 .55-.47.98-.97 1.21C7.85 18.75 7 20.24 7 22"/>
  <path d="M14 14.66V17c0 .55.47.98.97 1.21C16.15 18.75 17 20.24 17 22"/>
  <path d="M18 2H6v7a6 6 0 0 0 12 0V2z"/>
</svg> TH Espacio de Danza
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="h-px bg-white/[0.06] mb-16"></div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      <div class="bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/[0.08] rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-white/[0.07] hover:border-[#399ABE]/30 transition-all duration-200">
        <div class="flex gap-0.5 mb-4"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F59E0B"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F59E0B"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F59E0B"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F59E0B"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F59E0B"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg></div>
        <p class="text-[14px] text-[#a0b4c4] leading-relaxed italic mb-5">&ldquo;AKDEMIApp nos ha ayudado a tener un mejor control de nuestros grupos, profesores y matrículas. El panel es muy intuitivo, y el soporte que hemos recibido ha sido rápido y cercano. La automatización de cobros y recordatorios nos ha permitido gestionar mejor los ingresos y controlar la morosidad.&rdquo;</p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 pt-4 border-t border-white/[0.06]">
          <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#155D88] to-[#399ABE] flex items-center justify-center text-white text-[12px] font-bold shrink-0">VV</div>
          <div><p class="text-[13px] font-bold text-white">Vinicio Villalobos</p><p class="text-[11px] text-[#5a7080] mt-0.5">Propietario · Deyabu Dance Center · Costa Rica</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/[0.08] rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-white/[0.07] hover:border-[#399ABE]/30 transition-all duration-200">
        <div class="flex gap-0.5 mb-4"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F59E0B"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F59E0B"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F59E0B"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F59E0B"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#374151"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg></div>
        <p class="text-[14px] text-[#a0b4c4] leading-relaxed italic mb-5">&ldquo;Llevábamos tiempo buscando una solución completa para la gestión de la academia y por fin la encontramos en AKDEMIApp. La configuración inicial fue rápida y en pocas semanas todo el equipo estaba usando la plataforma sin problemas. Nos ha permitido crecer sin perder el control de la gestión diaria.&rdquo;</p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 pt-4 border-t border-white/[0.06]">
          <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#155D88] to-[#399ABE] flex items-center justify-center text-white text-[12px] font-bold shrink-0">GG</div>
          <div><p class="text-[13px] font-bold text-white">Gissel Gimenez</p><p class="text-[11px] text-[#5a7080] mt-0.5">Directora · Teacher Gissel Physicals · Panamá</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/[0.08] rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-white/[0.07] hover:border-[#399ABE]/30 transition-all duration-200">
        <div class="flex gap-0.5 mb-4"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F59E0B"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F59E0B"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F59E0B"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F59E0B"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F59E0B"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg></div>
        <p class="text-[14px] text-[#a0b4c4] leading-relaxed italic mb-5">&ldquo;Para nosotros era fundamental llevar un control claro de grupos, modalidades y asistencia. AKDEMIApp nos lo pone muy fácil y además nos ayuda a mantener informados a los alumnos con mensajes de cambios de clases, ensayos generales y fechas importantes. Es una solución muy completa para academias exigentes.&rdquo;</p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 pt-4 border-t border-white/[0.06]">
          <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#155D88] to-[#399ABE] flex items-center justify-center text-white text-[12px] font-bold shrink-0">VS</div>
          <div><p class="text-[13px] font-bold text-white">Valeria Sanchez</p><p class="text-[11px] text-[#5a7080] mt-0.5">Directora · Allonge Studio · Panamá</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
